  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Overview:
This macro script is designed for Grand Theft Auto V Roleplay (GTA 5 RP) on the FiveM platform, specifically tailored for automating the Gold Panning activity. The Keyran v1.3.6 Macro is programmed to execute precise movements in circular patterns, emulating a character engaged in Gold Panning, and utilizes the Gold Pan item at regular intervals.

Features:

Gold Panning Automation:

The macro automates the process of Gold Panning in GTA 5 RP.
Simulates realistic circular movements to mimic a character actively panning for gold.
Timed Gold Pan Usage:

The script incorporates a timing mechanism to ensure the Gold Pan is used at intervals.
The Gold Pan is triggered once every 30 seconds, optimizing the efficiency of the gold panning activity.
Customizable Parameters:

Users can easily customize the script parameters to adapt to different in-game scenarios.
Adjustable settings include movement speed, pan usage interval, and circle diameter.
Anti-Detection Mechanisms:

Built-in features to minimize the risk of detection by server or anti-cheat systems.
Randomized movement patterns and interval variations contribute to a more natural behavior.
User-Friendly Interface:

A simple and intuitive interface for users to configure and run the macro effortlessly.
Clear instructions provided within the script for easy setup and customization.

Disclaimer:
This macro is created solely for entertainment purposes and should be used responsibly. The developers and distributors of this script are not responsible for any consequences resulting from the use of this macro, including but not limited to server bans or other penalties.</Description>
